{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816970/extras/63a3c08f4ce2804821ee58332bf2434a.avif?t=1756990534\" width=616 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a forest covered in toxic mist, your campfire is your only safe spot, keep it burning with wood and special mixes or risk losing your ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816970/extras/f9058bad56ec87f108b81856028481fe.avif?t=1756990534\" width=616 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather wood, stone, and herbs, craft gear, prepare mixes to level up the fire and push the mist back, each upgrade needs different items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816970/extras/f41e5f6f78337f64c697139845d0d8ca.avif?t=1756990534\" width=616 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different with procedurally generated forests, resource spots, and danger zones, explore and adapt to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816970/extras/d3f82e73effb1e50322100835417551d.avif?t=1756990534\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 99 days to clear the mist, explore mines, fight monsters, uncover the story.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816970?t=1756990534","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816970?t=1756990534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co